__pycache__/
_how_to/*
!_how_to/.gitkeep
# _workingspace: 査証ログ・日記・計画の運用 README のみ追跡し、月次 *.md はコミットしない
_workingspace/*
!_workingspace/.gitkeep
!_workingspace/log/
_workingspace/log/*
!_workingspace/log/README.md
!_workingspace/diary/
_workingspace/diary/*
!_workingspace/diary/README.md
!_workingspace/plans/
_workingspace/plans/*
!_workingspace/plans/README.md
writers/*
!writers/000_default/writer_profile.md
novels/*
!novels/.gitkeep
!novels/.gitignore
!novels/_import/
novels/_import/*
!novels/_import/.gitkeep
!novels/000_old_man_next_door's_cake/
!novels/000_old_man_next_door's_cake/*
!novels/000_old_man_next_door's_cake/**   # サブフォルダまで許可
progress.md
**/unused
.claude/*
.vscode/*
.cursor/*
.codex/*
.github/*
.kilocode/*
.kilo/
.agents/
.kiloignore
kilo.jsonc
.cursorignore
.mcp.json
.env
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.serena/*
outputs/
logs/

# LLM / ローカル試行用（中身はコミットしない。README のみ追跡）
tools_temp/*
!tools_temp/README.md
